[{"id":"app-testing-session-startup","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["Appium","会话"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十二)Appium 架构与会话.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十二)Appium 架构与会话","articlePath":"posts/c877e017/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十二)Appium 架构与会话.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十二)Appium 架构与会话","articlePath":"posts/c877e017/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Appium 会话启动失败时，为什么不能先改定位器？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>会话还未建立时尚未进入元素定位阶段，应先按客户端、Server、驱动、ADB、安装和 Activity 分层排障。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Appium session (会话) 是客户端、Appium Server、设备驱动和目标设备之间维持的一次自动化连接。保存客户端异常、Server/驱动日志、ADB 状态、APK 信息和设备时间线，先确认目标 App 已安装并能启动；会话都没有建立时，页面还不存在，修改 locator (定位器) 不会改变根因。只有会话稳定建立后，才进入页面层和定位器诊断。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-pydantic-v1-migration","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["Pydantic","迁移"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十四)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十四)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/f8ac9084/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十四)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十四)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/f8ac9084/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Pydantic v1 到 v2 的迁移如何证明没有改变接口契约？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>用相同输入和 ORM fixture 比较验证结果、响应 JSON、弃用警告和 OpenAPI Schema；差异必须能解释。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先把 \u003ccode>orm_mode\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>dict()\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>json()\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>parse_obj()\u003c/code> 和 Settings 导入替换为 v2 对应 API，再重跑原有正反用例。响应字段、错误 \u003ccode>loc\u003c/code>、日期/UUID 编码和 OpenAPI required 集合应保持一致；如果发生有意变更，应单独更新版本和迁移说明。把 \u003ccode>ORJSONResponse\u003c/code> 等性能选择混入迁移会让证据无法归因。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-pom-boundary","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["POM","测试框架"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(八)测试框架设计.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(八)测试框架设计","articlePath":"posts/c92e7868/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(八)测试框架设计.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(八)测试框架设计","articlePath":"posts/c92e7868/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Page Object 最重要的职责边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>封装稳定页面语言，不接管测试数据和全部业务断言。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Page Object 集中 Locator 与用户操作；Fixture 管资源，API Client 管服务调用，测试保留关键业务目标和断言，失败报告才容易理解。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>让不同层各自保留一种职责：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>层\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>适合放什么\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Page Object\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>Locator 和稳定的用户操作\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Fixture\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>Context、账号、数据和清理\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>API Client\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端准备、核验和清理\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>测试\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>业务目标与关键断言\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>如果 Page Object 既创建数据又吞掉所有断言，失败报告只会剩下一串低层动作，无法看出业务哪里不成立。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-oop-method-kinds","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","OOP","实例方法","类方法","静态方法"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(七)面向对象与数据模型.md","articleTitle":"Python(七)面向对象与数据模型","articlePath":"posts/1aeb52d0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(七)面向对象与数据模型.md","articleTitle":"Python(七)面向对象与数据模型","articlePath":"posts/1aeb52d0/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>实例方法、类方法和静态方法如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>依赖实例状态用实例方法，依赖类状态或备用构造器用类方法，无自动对象参数的相关工具函数用静态方法。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三种方法的差别在于调用时自动绑定的对象：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">14\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">class\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title class_\">User\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">__init__\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self, name\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>.name = name\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">display\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self\u003c/span>):              \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># self：实例状态\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>.name\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">    @classmethod\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">anonymous\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">cls\u003c/span>):             \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># cls：类状态/备用构造\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> cls(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;anonymous&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">    @staticmethod\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">valid_name\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">name\u003c/span>):           \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 无需 self/cls 的相关逻辑\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">bool\u003c/span>(name.strip())\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>需要实例数据时选实例方法，需要类对象或备用构造器时选类方法；既不依赖实例也不依赖类的函数才适合静态方法。普通工具函数放在模块层通常更直接。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-container-hashable","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","hash","dict","set"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么列表不能作为字典键或集合元素？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>列表可变，哈希值无法稳定；字典键和集合元素必须可哈希。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>字典和集合用哈希值定位，再用相等性确认对象。若键放入后哈希值能改变，原来的桶位置就不再可靠：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">key = (\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;region&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">table = &#123;key: \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;test&quot;\u003c/span>&#125;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(table[key])\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">hash\u003c/span>((\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;region&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>)))\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">hash\u003c/span>((\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;region&quot;\u003c/span>, [])))  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># TypeError：内部列表不可哈希\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>所以可哈希要求不仅是“外层看起来不可变”，还要求参与相等性和哈希的全部成员都稳定。列表、字典和集合不能直接作为键；含有它们的元组也不行。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-12-app-role-grants-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["角色","最小权限","GRANT"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十二)安全与权限.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十二)安全与权限","articlePath":"posts/aa88466a/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十二)安全与权限.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十二)安全与权限","articlePath":"posts/aa88466a/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为订单应用创建只允许读写 orders、order_items 和 inventory 的角色，并绑定到应用账户；如何写出最小权限授权？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE\u003c/span> ROLE \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_order_rw&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">USER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_app&#x27;\u003c/span>@\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;10.20.%&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  IDENTIFIED \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WITH\u003c/span> caching_sha2_password \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> RANDOM PASSWORD\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  REQUIRE SSL;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GRANT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">INSERT\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> shoplab.orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">TO\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_order_rw&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GRANT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">INSERT\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> shoplab.order_items \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">TO\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_order_rw&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GRANT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> shoplab.inventory \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">TO\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_order_rw&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GRANT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_order_rw&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">TO\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_app&#x27;\u003c/span>@\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;10.20.%&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SET\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DEFAULT\u003c/span> ROLE \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_order_rw&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">TO\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_app&#x27;\u003c/span>@\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;10.20.%&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SHOW\u003c/span> GRANTS \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FOR\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;shoplab_app&#x27;\u003c/span>@\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;10.20.%&#x27;\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这组授权要同时验证“能做什么”和“不能做什么”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>检查\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>预期\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE\u003c/code> 目标三张表\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>成功\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>读取其他业务表\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>拒绝\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>DROP\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>ALTER\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>GRANT OPTION\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不存在\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>非 TLS 或未匹配 host 的连接\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>拒绝\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>&#39;user&#39;@&#39;host&#39;\u003c/code> 是授权身份的一部分，\u003ccode>%\u003c/code> 过宽会让来源边界无法审计。\u003ccode>RANDOM PASSWORD\u003c/code> 的回显必须交给安全凭据系统，部署工具若不支持该流程，就在安全通道外部生成并注入，绝不能把密码或日志回显写入仓库。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a03-concept-2","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["Scrum","Sprint"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(三)研发流程与敏捷协作.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(三)研发流程与敏捷协作","articlePath":"posts/562e1ecf/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(三)研发流程与敏捷协作.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(三)研发流程与敏捷协作","articlePath":"posts/562e1ecf/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Sprint 待办能否调整？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>能。Developers 更新计划；范围可与 Product Owner 澄清和重新协商，但不能危及 Sprint 目标或降低质量。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Sprint Backlog 包含 Sprint 目标、选入的产品待办和交付计划，它会随学习而更新。假设目标是可靠借阅，执行时发现库存一致性问题，就要把修复与复查纳入计划；必要时与 Product Owner 协商缩减不影响目标的范围。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>变化\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>判断\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>为完成可靠借阅增加失败恢复检查\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>调整实现计划，检查目标是否仍可达到\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>为赶时间取消必要检查并宣称 Done\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>降低质量，不应把未满足 DoD 的工作算作完成\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>临时插入完整营销模块\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>评估是否危及目标，不能以“敏捷拥抱变化”为由直接塞入\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>改变计划不等于随意改变目标。评审用于检查成果和适应后续工作，不是把未完成测试事后补成通过的地方。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a08-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["判定表","横杠"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/"}],"articleIndex":13,"articleCount":15,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>判定表中的横杠代表什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它表示该条件对当前规则的动作没有区分作用，但前提是其他取值不会改变结果、错误、状态或证据。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>借阅规则中会员无效时，库存是否可借不影响“拒绝借阅”，可以写横杠；如果产品要求错误提示优先级取决于库存，则不能横杠。横杠不是缺少测试数据的借口，合并前要检查所有可观察输出和副作用，并在追踪中说明依据。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]